Hello

I'm running my VxWork application on top of Xenomai (2.4.10).
The Application periodically writes data to HDD (NFS) and doing some
calculations, also prints a lot of debugs.
There are 66 tasks with different priorities, the tasks which do most of job
have priorities from 50 ~ 80.

Actually I adjusted the value of /proc/xenomai/latency to 4395 making
minimal latency closer to zero for non workload case.
But for that Latency tests I set the value of /proc/xenomai/latency to 0,
just to demonstrate these huge values I got (since I'm getting similar when
it is 4395),

I start my application and run a test, when application done - I stop the
test.
